# 7. How the Form Works

Think of it like this:

```text
Form
 │
 ├── Email TextFormField
 │       ↓
 │    validator
 │
 ├── Password TextFormField
 │       ↓
 │    validator
 │
 └── Login Button
         ↓
   validate()
         ↓
 ┌───────────────┐
 │ All valid?    │
 └───────────────┘
      ↓       ↓
     YES      NO
      ↓        ↓
  Submit    Show errors
```

The important line is:

```dart
if (formKey.currentState!.validate())
```

When this runs, Flutter calls the `validator` of each `TextFormField`.

