# 8. Reading Form Values

Using controllers:

```dart
final emailController = TextEditingController();
```

Then:

```dart
emailController.text
```

gets the entered value.

Example:

```dart
print(emailController.text);
```

For clearing:

```dart
emailController.clear();
```

